.TH ZHEN\-EVAL 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 86590d34" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
zhen\-eval \- Run the two\-brains eval: the same tasks on the local model or on Claude, judged mechanically.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zhen\-eval
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the two\-brains eval: the same tasks on the local model or on Claude, judged mechanically.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-answers\-dir \fISTRING\fR
also keep each answer as <dir>/<backend>\-<task>.txt (outside the repo)
.TP
.B \-\-backend \fISTRING\fR
local (llama\-server) or claude (default local)
.TP
.B \-\-claude\-max\-tokens \fIN\fR
Claude max_tokens for key tasks (thinking counts) (default 4096)
.TP
.B \-\-claude\-repo\-max\-tokens \fIN\fR
Claude max_tokens for repo tasks (default 8192)
.TP
.B \-\-daily\-cap\-usd \fINUM\fR
hard Claude spend cap for the UTC day (default 3)
.TP
.B \-\-effort \fISTRING\fR
Claude effort (default low)
.TP
.B \-\-family \fISTRING\fR
comma\-separated families (default: every scored family)
.TP
.B \-\-keys \fISTRING\fR
pre\-registered keys (default eval/two\-brains/keys.jsonl)
.TP
.B \-\-ledger \fISTRING\fR
spend ledger (default: zhen\-claude's)
.TP
.B \-\-limit \fIN\fR
stop after this many tasks (0 = all)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-max\-tokens \fIN\fR
local max_tokens for key tasks (default 1024)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-repo\-max\-tokens \fIN\fR
local max_tokens for repo tasks (default 2048)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
per local attempt; slower counts as a failed attempt (PREREG) (default 2m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-url \fISTRING\fR
llama\-server URL (default http://127.0.0.1:8081)
.TP
.B \-\-model \fISTRING\fR
model name (local: the label recorded and sent; claude: model id, default claude\-opus\-5\-5)
.TP
.B \-\-out \fISTRING\fR
results JSONL (appended)
.TP
.B \-\-prompts \fISTRING\fR
coding\-gate prompts (default eval/coding\-gate/prompts.jsonl)
.TP
.B \-\-repo\-attempts \fIN\fR
local attempts for repo\-task (the second sees the check output; PREREG) (default 2)
.TP
.B \-\-root \fISTRING\fR
repository root (fixture refs are relative to it) (default .)
.TP
.B \-\-seed \fIN\fR
local seed (temperature is 0) (default 42)
.TP
.B \-\-skip\-done
skip tasks already in \-out for this backend and model
.TP
.B \-\-split \fISTRING\fR
tune, holdout or all (default all)
.TP
.B \-\-tasks \fISTRING\fR
tasks with their split (default eval/two\-brains/split.jsonl)
.TP
.B \-\-work\-dir \fISTRING\fR
where fixture copies are made (default: a temp dir)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
